   "data": {
    "text": "FRAME & CANVAS\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 10, CC 97 to 107\n   1 Punch-in and reframe\n   2 Mirror and rotate\n   3 Steadying\n   4 Canvas edges\n   5 Fake camera move\n   6 3D frame move\n   7 Focus changed in the edit\n   8 pair: When the joke pays off, the editor punches in\n   9 pair: When the camera goes handheld, the shake is left in\n  10 pair: When impacts rise, the editor slam zooms\n  11 pairs: The editor tells the joke"
   },
